<!-- doc/src/sgml/release-19.sgml -->
<!-- See header comment in release.sgml about typical markup -->

<sect1 id="release-19">
 <title>发布版本 19</title>

 <formalpara>
  <title>发布日期：</title>
  <para>2026-??-??，截至 2026-07-18</para>
 </formalpara>

  <sect2 id="release-19-highlights">
   <title>概览</title>

   <para>
    <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 包含许多新特性和增强，包括：
   </para>

   <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      支持
      <link linkend="ddl-property-graphs">属性图查询</link>
      （<acronym>SQL/PGQ</acronym>）。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      新增 <link linkend="sql-repack"><command>REPACK</command></link> 命令，
      用于回收磁盘空间并重新组织表内容，它结合了现有
      <command>VACUUM FULL</command> 和 <command>CLUSTER</command> 命令的功能。
      其 <literal>CONCURRENTLY</literal> 选项允许在不阻塞对表的读写操作的情况下
      执行 <command>REPACK</command>。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      逻辑复制现在可以
      <link linkend="logical-replication-sequences">复制序列值</link>，
      并且当 <xref linkend="guc-wal-level"/> 设置为 <literal>replica</literal> 时，
      可以在不重启服务器的情况下启用逻辑复制。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      自动清理现在可以使用
      <link linkend="guc-autovacuum-max-parallel-workers">并行工作进程</link>
      清理表的索引，并通过一套
      <link linkend="autovacuum-priority">新的评分系统</link>
      优先处理最需要清理或分析的表。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      现在可以在数据库服务器运行期间
      <link linkend="checksums-online-enable-disable">启用或禁用数据校验和</link>。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      新增 <link linkend="sql-wait-for"><command>WAIT FOR</command></link> 命令，
      它会等待备库重放到指定位置，从而在备库查询中支持
      <quote>读己之写</quote>模式。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      通过新的
      <link linkend="dml-application-time-update-delete"><literal>FOR PORTION OF</literal></link>
      子句支持时态更新和删除。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      新增
      <link linkend="pgplanadvice"><application>pg_plan_advice</application></link>
      扩展，用于稳定和控制查询规划器的决策；同时新增配套的
      <link linkend="pgstashadvice"><application>pg_stash_advice</application></link>
      扩展，用于按查询自动应用这些建议。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      改进了多个方面的性能，包括自动调整 I/O 工作进程数量、加快外键检查，
      以及进一步优化规划和执行。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </itemizedlist>

   <para>
    上述条目以及
    <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 的其他新特性，在下面各节中会作更详细的说明。
   </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2  id="release-19-migration">

   <title>迁移到版本 19</title>

   <para>
    对于想从任何先前版本迁移数据的用户，需要使用 <xref linkend="app-pg-dumpall"/> 执行导出/恢复，或者使用
    <xref linkend="pgupgrade"/> ，或者使用逻辑复制。有关迁移到新主版本的一般信息，请参见 <xref
    linkend="upgrading"/> 。
   </para>

   <para>
    19 版本包含若干可能影响与先前版本兼容性的更改。请注意以下不兼容项：
   </para>

   <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-02-11 [1d92e0c2c] Add password expiration warnings.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-password-expiration-warning-threshold"><varname>password_expiration_warning_threshold</varname></link>，用于提示密码即将过期（Gilles Darold，Nathan Bossart）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1d92e0c2c">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
默认警告期为七天。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-02-23 [bc60ee860] Warn upon successful MD5 password authentication.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
在成功完成 MD5 密码认证后发出警告（Nathan Bossart）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bc60ee860">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
可以通过服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-md5-password-warnings"><varname>md5_password_warnings</varname></link> 禁用该警告。MD5 密码已在 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 中被标记为弃用。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2026-04-08 [a1643d40b] Remove RADIUS support.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
移除 <acronym>RADIUS</acronym> 支持（Thomas Munro）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a1643d40b">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
<productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 只支持通过 <acronym>UDP</acronym> 的 <acronym>RADIUS</acronym>，而这存在无法修复的安全问题。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-01-21 [457620845] Force standard_conforming_strings to always be ON.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
强制数据库服务器中的 <link linkend="guc-standard-conforming-strings"><varname>standard_conforming_strings</varname></link> 始终为 <literal>on</literal>（Tom Lane）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;457620845">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
使用 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 之前版本的 <link linkend="app-pgdump"><application>pg_dump</application></link>
或 <link linkend="app-pg-dumpall"><application>pg_dumpall</application></link> 创建、且使用了 <literal>standard_conforming_strings = off</literal> 的转储，
将无法正确载入 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 及更高版本的服务器。用户应使用这些应用程序的 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19
或更高版本创建转储，或者使用 <literal>standard_conforming_strings = on</literal>。
</para>

<para>
为了兼容旧服务器，客户端应用程序仍然支持在 <literal>standard_conforming_strings = off</literal> 的服务器上执行操作。服务器变量 <varname>escape_string_warning</varname> 已被移除，因为已无必要。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-02-23 [b380a56a3] Disallow CR and LF in database, role, and tablespace nam
-->

<listitem>
<para>
禁止数据库名、角色名和表空间名中出现回车和换行（Mahendra Singh Thalor）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b380a56a3">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
这样做是为了避免安全问题。<link linkend="pgupgrade"><application>pg_upgrade</application></link> 也会拒绝升级那些使用此类名称的数据库集簇。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-01-08 [b3b0b4571] Create btree_gist v1.9, in which inet/cidr opclasses are
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-01-08 [b352d3d80] Mark GiST inet_ops as opcdefault, and deal with ensuing
-->

<listitem>
<para>
将 <link linkend="datatype-net-types"><type>inet</type></link> 和 <link linkend="datatype-net-types"><type>cidr</type></link> 数据类型的默认索引操作符类从 <xref linkend="btree-gist"/> 改为 <link linkend="gist">GiST</link>（Tom Lane）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b3b0b4571">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b352d3d80">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
<xref linkend="btree-gist"/> 的 <type>inet</type>/<type>cidr</type> 操作符类存在缺陷，因为它们可能排除本应返回的行。<link linkend="pgupgrade"><application>pg_upgrade</application></link> 将拒绝升级包含 <xref linkend="btree-gist"/> <type>inet</type>/<type>cidr</type> 索引的数据库集簇。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-04-06 [a9c350d9e] Don't try to re-order the subcommands of CREATE SCHEMA.
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-04-06 [404db8f9e] Execute foreign key constraints in CREATE SCHEMA at the
-->

<listitem>
<para>
停止重排由 <link linkend="sql-createschema"><command>CREATE SCHEMA</command></link> 创建的非模式对象（Tom Lane，Jian He）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a9c350d9e">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;404db8f9e">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
重排的目的是避免依赖关系，但它并不完善。<productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 现在使用显式指定的对象顺序，外键除外，外键会最后创建。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-04-06 [21c69dc73] Disallow system columns in COPY FROM WHERE conditions.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
禁止在 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM ... WHERE</command></link> 中使用系统列（Tom Lane）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;21c69dc73">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
这些列的值并未明确定义。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-05-01 [8d829f5a0] Fix JSON_ARRAY(query) empty set handling and view depars
-->

<listitem>
<para>
将不返回任何行的 <link linkend="functions-json"><function>json_array()</function></link> 调用改为返回空 <acronym>JSON</acronym> 数组（Richard Guo）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8d829f5a0">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
此前会返回 <literal>NULL</literal>。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Etsuro Fujita <efujita@postgresql.org>
2026-04-05 [de28140de] postgres_fdw: Inherit the local transaction's access/def
-->

<listitem>
<para>
让事务把其 <literal>READ ONLY</literal> 和 <literal>DEFERRABLE</literal> 状态传递给 <xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 会话（Etsuro Fujita）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;de28140de">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
这意味着 <literal>READ ONLY</literal> 事务将不能再修改由 <xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 会话处理的行。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2026-04-03 [79534f906] Change default of max_locks_per_transaction to 128
-->

<listitem>
<para>
将 <link linkend="guc-max-locks-per-transaction"><varname>max_locks_per_transaction</varname></link> 的默认值从 64 改为 128（Heikki Linnakangas）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;79534f906">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
锁大小分配方式已经改变，因此要达到与先前版本相同的容量，实际上现在必须将设置值翻倍。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2026-04-02 [7f8c88c2b] jit: Change the default to off.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
默认禁用 <link linkend="jit"><acronym>JIT</acronym></link>（Jelte Fennema-Nio）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7f8c88c2b">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
之前 <acronym>JIT</acronym> 默认启用，并根据优化器代价决定是否激活。不幸的是，这种代价估算被认为并不可靠，因此需要大量运行大型分析查询的站点手工启用 <acronym>JIT</acronym>。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-18 [3edaf29fa] Rename two columns in pg_stat_subscription_stats.
-->

<listitem><para>将 <structfield>sync_error_count</structfield> 重命名为 <structfield>sync_table_error_count</structfield>，该列位于系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-subscription-stats"><structname>pg_stat_subscription_stats</structname></link> 中（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3edaf29fa">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这是因为现在会单独跟踪序列错误。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-12-03 [6c5c393b7] Rename BUFFERPIN wait event class to BUFFER
-->

<listitem>
<para>
将等待事件类型 <literal>BUFFERPIN</literal> 重命名为 <literal>BUFFER</literal>（Andres Freund）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c5c393b7">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-12-30 [bc6374cd7] Change IndexAmRoutines to be statically-allocated struct
-->

<listitem>
<para>
将索引访问方法处理器改为使用静态分配的 <link linkend="indexam"><structname>IndexAmRoutines</structname></link> 结构体，而不是动态分配的结构体（Matthias van de Meent）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bc6374cd7">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

</listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-03-09 [91f33a2ae] Replace get_relation_info_hook with build_simple_rel_hoo
-->

<listitem>
<para>
移除优化器钩子 get_relation_info_hook，并新增位置更合适的钩子 build_simple_rel_hook（Robert Haas）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;91f33a2ae">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-06-26 [4df5fe383] 2026-06-26 Make crosstabview honor boolean/null display
-->

<listitem>
<para>
修改 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 的 <literal>\crosstabview</literal> 命令，使其遵循 <literal>\pset null</literal> 设置（Chao Li）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4df5fe383">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2026-04-08 [77645d44e] Remove MULE_INTERNAL encoding.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
移除 <literal>MULE_INTERNAL</literal> 编码（Thomas Munro）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;77645d44e">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
这种编码很复杂，而且很少使用。使用它的数据库将需要使用不同的编码进行导出和恢复。
</para>
</listitem>

   </itemizedlist>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 id="release-19-changes">
   <title>变更</title>

    <para>
     下文将详细介绍
     <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 与上一个主版本之间的变更。
    </para>

   <sect3 id="release-19-server">
    <title>服务器</title>

    <sect4 id="release-19-optimizer">
     <title>优化器</title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-03-12 [383eb21eb] Convert NOT IN sublinks to anti-joins when safe
-->

<listitem><para>在不存在 NULL 时，允许将 <literal>NOT IN</literal> 转换为更高效的 <literal>ANTI JOIN</literal>（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;383eb21eb">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-02-12 [cf74558fe] Reduce LEFT JOIN to ANTI JOIN using NOT NULL constraints
-->

<listitem><para>允许更多 <literal>LEFT JOIN</literal> 转换为 <literal>ANTI JOIN</literal>（Tender Wang，Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cf74558fe">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-07-03 [0da29e4cb] Enable use of Memoize for ANTI joins
-->

<listitem><para>允许在唯一内侧的 <literal>ANTI JOIN</literal> 中使用 Memoize（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0da29e4cb">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-10-08 [8e1185910] Implement Eager Aggregation
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [bd94845e8] Fix collation handling for grouping keys in eager aggreg
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [3a08a2a8b] Fix volatile function evaluation in eager aggregation
-->

<listitem><para>允许在连接之前先执行某些聚合处理（Richard Guo，Antonin Houska）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8e1185910">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bd94845e8">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3a08a2a8b">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这可以减少需要处理的行数。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-03-19 [1811f1af9] Improve hash join's handling of tuples with null join ke
-->

<listitem><para>改进哈希连接对带 <literal>NULL</literal> 连接键元组的处理（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1811f1af9">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-08-19 [24225ad9a] Pathify RHS unique-ification for semijoin planning
-->

<listitem><para>改进半连接规划（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;24225ad9a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-07-08 [55a780e94] Consider explicit incremental sort for Append and MergeA
-->

<listitem><para>允许 Append 和 MergeAppend 考虑显式增量排序（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;55a780e94">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-02-10 [f41ab5157] Teach planner to transform "x IS [NOT] DISTINCT FROM NUL
-->

<listitem><para>在常量折叠期间将 <link linkend="functions-comparison-pred-table"><literal>IS [NOT] DISTINCT FROM NULL</literal></link> 转换为 <literal>IS [NOT] NULL</literal>（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f41ab5157">&sect;</ulink></para><para>后一种形式更易优化。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-02-10 [0a3796125] Optimize IS DISTINCT FROM with non-nullable inputs
-->

<listitem>
<para>
当输入被证明非空时，将 <link linkend="functions-comparison-pred-table"><literal>IS [NOT] DISTINCT FROM</literal></link> 简化为等值/不等值操作符（Richard Guo）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0a3796125">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-07-22 [e2debb643] Reduce "Var IS [NOT] NULL" quals during constant folding
-->

<listitem><para>在优化器中更早地对 <replaceable>var</replaceable> <literal>IS [NOT] NULL</literal> 做常量折叠（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e2debb643">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这为后续优化创造了条件。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-12-24 [10c4fe074] Simplify COALESCE expressions using non-nullable argumen
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-12-24 [cb7b7ec7a] Optimize ROW(...) IS [NOT] NULL using non-nullable field
-->

<listitem><para>简化 <link linkend="functions-coalesce-nvl-ifnull"><function>COALESCE()</function></link> 和 <literal>ROW(...) IS [NOT] NULL</literal>，以避免求值不必要的参数（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;10c4fe074">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cb7b7ec7a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2026-02-10 [0aaf0de7f] Optimize BooleanTest with non-nullable input
-->

<listitem><para>当输入被证明非空时，将 <literal>IS [NOT] TRUE/FALSE/UNKNOWN</literal> 简化为普通 boolean 表达式（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0aaf0de7f">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-11-19 [057012b20] Speed up eqjoinsel() with lots of MCV entries.
-->

<listitem><para>加快大统计目标下的连接选择率计算（Ilia Evdokimov，David Geier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;057012b20">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-09-20 [1eccb9315] Re-allow using statistics for bool-valued functions in W
-->

<listitem><para>为返回 boolean 值的函数启用正确的优化器统计信息（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1eccb9315">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2026-04-01 [f7f4052a4] Add support for extended statistics on virtual generated
-->

<listitem><para>允许在虚拟生成列上使用<link linkend="sql-createstatistics">扩展统计信息</link>（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f7f4052a4">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-26 [0e80f3f88] Add pg_restore_extended_stats()
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-27 [302879bd6] Add support for "dependencies" in pg_restore_extended_st
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-29 [efbebb4e8] Add support for "mcv" in pg_restore_extended_stats()
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-03 [ba97bf9cb] Add support for "exprs" in pg_restore_extended_stats()
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="functions-admin-statsmod"><function>pg_restore_extended_stats()</function></link> 恢复优化器扩展统计信息（Corey Huinker，Michael Paquier，Chao Li）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0e80f3f88">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;302879bd6">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;efbebb4e8">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ba97bf9cb">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-16 [d756fa101] Add pg_clear_extended_stats()
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-admin-statsmod"><function>pg_clear_extended_stats()</function></link> 用于删除扩展统计信息（Corey Huinker，Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d756fa101">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-03-09 [8300d3ad4] Consider startup cost as a figure of merit for partial p
-->

<listitem><para>调整优化器，使其在部分路径决策时考虑启动代价（Robert Haas，Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8300d3ad4">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-10-08 [185e30426] Allow negative aggtransspace to indicate unbounded state
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="catalog-pg-aggregate"><structname>pg_aggregate</structname></link>.<link linkend="catalog-pg-aggregate"><structfield>aggtransspace</structfield></link> 为负值，以表示内存使用没有上限（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;185e30426">&sect;</ulink></para><para>该信息会被优化器用于规划内存使用。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-performance">
     <title>常规性能</title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-31 [2da86c1ef] Add fast path for foreign key constraint checks
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
2026-04-01 [e484b0eea] Fix two issues in fast-path FK check introduced by commi
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
2026-04-03 [b7b27eb41] Optimize fast-path FK checks with batched index probes
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [5c54c3ed1] Fix deferred FK check batching introduced by commit b7b2
-->

<listitem><para>改进外键约束检查性能（Junwang Zhao，Amit Langote，Chao Li）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2da86c1ef">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e484b0eea">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b7b27eb41">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5c54c3ed1">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-05 [a9ee66881] aio: io_uring: Trigger async processing for large IOs
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-05 [8ca147d58] read stream: Split decision about look ahead for AIO and
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-05 [f63ca3379] read_stream: Only increase read-ahead distance when wait
-->

<listitem><para>改进大请求下<link linkend="guc-io-method">异步 I/O</link>读预取调度（Andres Freund）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a9ee66881">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8ca147d58">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f63ca3379">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2026-04-08 [d1c01b79d] aio: Adjust I/O worker pool automatically.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="guc-io-method"><varname>io_method</varname></link> = "<literal>worker</literal>" 自动控制所需后台工作进程（Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d1c01b79d">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-io-min-workers"><varname>io_min_workers</varname></link>、<link linkend="guc-io-max-workers"><varname>io_max_workers</varname></link>、<link linkend="guc-io-worker-idle-timeout"><varname>io_worker_idle_timeout</varname></link> 和 <link linkend="guc-io-worker-launch-interval"><varname>io_worker_launch_interval</varname></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2026-03-30 [b46e1e54d] Allow on-access pruning to set pages all-visible
-->

<listitem><para>允许查询中的表扫描在<link linkend="vacuum-for-visibility-map">可见性映射</link>中将页面标记为全可见（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b46e1e54d">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前只有 <link linkend="sql-vacuum"><command>VACUUM</command></link> 和 <link
linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY ... FREEZE</command></link> 可以做到这一点。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [1ff3180ca] Allow autovacuum to use parallel vacuum workers.
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-04-10 [2a3d2f9f6] doc: Improve consistency of parallel vacuum description.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="autovacuum">自动清理</link> 使用<link linkend="reloption-autovacuum-parallel-workers"><varname>并行自动清理工作进程</varname></link>（Daniil Davydov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1ff3180ca">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2a3d2f9f6">&sect;</ulink></para><para>工作进程的最大数量由服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-autovacuum-max-parallel-workers"><varname>autovacuum_max_parallel_workers</varname></link> 和每表存储参数 <varname>autovacuum_parallel_workers</varname> 控制。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2025-11-27 [0ca3b1697] Add parallelism support for TID Range Scans
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="datatype-oid"><type>TID</type></link> 范围扫描并行执行（Cary Huang，David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0ca3b1697">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-13 [e0a3a3fd5] Optimize COPY FROM (FORMAT {text,csv}) using SIMD.
-->

<listitem><para>使用 <acronym>SIMD</acronym> CPU 指令提升 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM</command></link> 处理文本和 <acronym>CSV</acronym> 输入的性能（Nazir Bilal Yavuz，Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e0a3a3fd5">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-01-15 [282b1cde9] Optimize LISTEN/NOTIFY via shared channel map and direct
-->

<listitem><para>改进 <link linkend="sql-notify"><command>NOTIFY</command></link>，使其只唤醒正在监听指定通知的后端（Joel Jacobson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;282b1cde9">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前大多数后端都会被 <link linkend="sql-notify"><command>NOTIFY</command></link> 唤醒。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-05 [34dfca293] Change default value of default_toast_compression to "lz
-->

<listitem><para>将 <link linkend="storage-toast"><acronym>TOAST</acronym></link> 压缩默认方法从 <literal>pglz</literal> 改为更高效的 <literal>lz4</literal>（Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;34dfca293">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过修改服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-default-toast-compression"><varname>default_toast_compression</varname></link> 的默认值实现。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2026-03-16 [c456e3911] Optimize tuple deformation
-->

<listitem><para>改进内部行展开性能（David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c456e3911">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2026-01-06 [c4ff35f10] ICU: use UTF8-optimized case conversion API
-->

<listitem>
<para>
改进重复执行 <acronym>UTF-8</acronym> 大小写折叠操作的性能（Andreas Karlsson）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c4ff35f10">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-16 [bfa3c4f10] Optimize hash index bulk-deletion with streaming read
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-12 [6c228755a] Use streaming read for VACUUM cleanup of GIN
-->

<listitem>
<para>
使用流式读取改进 hash 索引批量删除和 <link linkend="gin"><literal>GIN</literal></link> 索引清理的性能（Xuneng Zhou）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bfa3c4f10">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c228755a">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
2026-02-14 [ef3c3cf6d] Perform radix sort on SortTuples with pass-by-value Datu
-->

<listitem><para>使用基数排序改进排序性能（John Naylor）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ef3c3cf6d">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-07 [294520c44] instrumentation: Use Time-Stamp Counter on x86-64 to low
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-07 [16fca4825] pg_test_timing: Also test RDTSC[P] timing, report time s
-->

<listitem><para>改进计时性能测量（Lukas Fittl、Andres Freund、David Geier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;294520c44">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;16fca4825">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这有利于 <link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, TIMING)</command></link> 和 <link linkend="pgtesttiming"><application>pg_test_timing</application></link>，并由服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-timing-clock-source"><varname>timing_clock_source</varname></link> 控制。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-03-20 [ce8d5fe0e] plpgsql: optimize "SELECT simple-expression INTO var".
-->

<listitem><para>优化 <link linkend="plpgsql"><application>plpgsql</application></link> 语法 <literal>SELECT simple-expression INTO</literal> <replaceable>var</replaceable>（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ce8d5fe0e">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-system-views">
     <title>系统视图</title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-24 [4019f725f] Add support for lock statistics in pgstats
-->

<listitem><para>新增系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-lock-view"><structname>pg_stat_lock</structname></link> 和函数 <link linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-lock-view"><function>pg_stat_get_lock()</function></link>，用于报告每种锁类型的统计信息（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4019f725f">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-06 [01d485b14] Add system view pg_stat_recovery
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-06 [2d4ead6f4] Fix order of columns in pg_stat_recovery
-->

<listitem><para>新增系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-recovery-view"><structname>pg_stat_recovery</structname></link>，用于报告恢复状态（Xuneng Zhou，Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;01d485b14">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2d4ead6f4">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [87f61f0c8] Add pg_stat_autovacuum_scores system view.
-->

<listitem><para>新增系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-autovacuum-scores-view"><structname>pg_stat_autovacuum_scores</structname></link>，用于报告每表 <link linkend="autovacuum">自动清理</link> 细节（Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;87f61f0c8">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-09 [167ed8082] Introduce pg_dsm_registry_allocations view.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-12-02 [f894acb24] Show size of DSAs and dshashes in pg_dsm_registry_alloca
-->

<listitem><para>新增系统视图 <link linkend="view-pg-dsm-registry-allocations"><structname>pg_dsm_registry_allocations</structname></link>，用于报告<link linkend="guc-dynamic-shared-memory-type">动态共享内存</link>细节（Florents Tselai，Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;167ed8082">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f894acb24">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-12-09 [0d7895206] Add mode and started_by columns to pg_stat_progress_vacu
-->

<listitem><para>在系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-progress-vacuum-view"><structname>pg_stat_progress_vacuum</structname></link> 中新增清理启动细节（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d7895206">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新的 <structfield>started_by</structfield> 列报告清理的发起者，<structfield>mode</structfield> 则表示其激进程度。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-12-09 [ab40db385] Add started_by column to pg_stat_progress_analyze view.
-->

<listitem><para>在系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-progress-analyze-view"><structname>pg_stat_progress_analyze</structname></link> 中新增分析启动细节（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ab40db385">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新的 <structfield>started_by</structfield> 列报告分析的发起者。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-10-08 [d3b6183dd] Add mem_exceeded_count column to pg_stat_replication_slo
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>mem_exceeded_count</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-replication-slots-view"><structname>pg_stat_replication_slots</structname></link>（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d3b6183dd">&sect;</ulink></para><para>它用于报告 <link linkend="guc-logical-decoding-work-mem"><varname>logical_decoding_work_mem</varname></link> 被超过的次数。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-25 [76b78721c] Add slotsync skip statistics.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-28 [e68b6adad] Add slotsync_skip_reason column to pg_replication_slots
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-12-05 [5db6a344a] Rename column slotsync_skip_at to slotsync_last_skip.
-->

<listitem><para>在 <link linkend="pg-stat-replication-slots-view"><structname>pg_stat_replication_slots</structname></link> 和 <link linkend="view-pg-replication-slots"><structname>pg_replication_slots</structname></link> 中新增复制槽同步跳过信息（Shlok Kyal）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;76b78721c">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e68b6adad">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5db6a344a">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增列为 <structfield>slotsync_skip_count</structfield>、<structfield>slotsync_last_skip</structfield> 和 <structfield>slotsync_skip_reason</structfield>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-08-04 [fd5a1a0c3] Detect and report update_deleted conflicts.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增 <structfield>update_deleted</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-subscription-stats"><structname>pg_stat_subscription_stats</structname></link>（Zhijie Hou）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fd5a1a0c3">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
该列报告因并发删除而忽略更新的行数。这要求订阅者启用 <varname>retain_dead_tuples</varname>。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-07 [f6a4c498d] Add seq_sync_error_count to subscription statistics.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-18 [3edaf29fa] Rename two columns in pg_stat_subscription_stats.
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>sync_seq_error_count</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-subscription-stats"><structname>pg_stat_subscription_stats</structname></link>，用于报告序列同步错误（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f6a4c498d">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3edaf29fa">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-10-06 [a5b543258] Add stats_reset to pg_stat_all_{tables,indexes} and rela
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>stats_reset</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-all-tables-view"><structname>pg_stat_all_tables</structname></link>、<link linkend="pg-stat-all-indexes-view"><structname>pg_stat_all_indexes</structname></link> 和 <link linkend="pg-statio-all-sequences-view"><structname>pg_statio_all_sequences</structname></link>（Bertrand Drouvot，Sami Imseih，Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a5b543258">&sect;</ulink></para><para>它也出现在 <literal>sys</literal> 和 <literal>user</literal> 变体视图中。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-10-08 [b71bae41a] Add stats_reset to pg_stat_user_functions
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-03-16 [8fe315f18] Add stats_reset column to pg_statio_all_sequences
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>stats_reset</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-user-functions-view"><structname>pg_stat_user_functions</structname></link> 和 <link linkend="pg-stat-database-conflicts-view"><structname>pg_stat_database_conflicts</structname></link>（Bertrand Drouvot，Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b71bae41a">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8fe315f18">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-01-01 [f3c9e341c] Add paths of extensions to pg_available_extensions
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>location</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="view-pg-available-extensions"><structname>pg_available_extensions</structname></link> 和 <link linkend="view-pg-available-extension-versions"><structname>pg_available_extension_versions</structname></link>，用于报告扩展所在的文件系统目录（Matheus Alcantara）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f3c9e341c">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-08-05 [deb674454] Add backup_type column to pg_stat_progress_basebackup.
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <structfield>backup_type</structfield> 列到系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-progress-basebackup-view"><structname>pg_stat_progress_basebackup</structname></link>，用于报告备份类型（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;deb674454">&sect;</ulink></para><para>可能的值为 <literal>full</literal> 或 <literal>incremental</literal>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-23 [a36164e74] Add WALRCV_CONNECTING state to the WAL receiver
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <literal>connecting</literal> 值到系统视图列 <link linkend="pg-stat-wal-receiver-view"><structname>pg_stat_wal_receiver</structname></link>.<link linkend="pg-stat-wal-receiver-view"><structfield>status</structfield></link>（Xuneng Zhou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a36164e74">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-10-28 [f9a09aa29] Add wal_fpi_bytes to pg_stat_wal and pg_stat_get_backend
-->

<listitem><para>新增对写入 <acronym>WAL</acronym> 的整页镜像字节数的报告（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f9a09aa29">&sect;</ulink></para><para>可通过系统视图 <link linkend="pg-stat-wal-view"><structname>pg_stat_wal</structname></link> 和函数 <link linkend="pg-stat-get-backend-wal"><function>pg_stat_get_backend_wal()</function></link> 访问。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-17 [3b88e50d6] Add more columns to pg_stats, pg_stats_ext, and pg_stats
-->

<listitem><para>在系统视图 <link linkend="view-pg-stats"><structname>pg_stats</structname></link>、<link linkend="view-pg-stats-ext"><structname>pg_stats_ext</structname></link> 和 <link linkend="view-pg-stats-ext-exprs"><structname>pg_stats_ext_exprs</structname></link> 中新增列（Corey Huinker）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3b88e50d6">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增表 <type>OID</type> 和属性号列到 <link linkend="view-pg-stats"><structname>pg_stats</structname></link>，并为另外两个视图新增表 <type>OID</type> 和统计对象 <type>OID</type> 列。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-02-10 [307447e6d] Add information about range type stats to pg_stats_ext_e
-->

<listitem><para>为范围类型的<link linkend="sql-createstatistics">扩展统计信息</link>在系统视图 <link linkend="view-pg-stats-ext-exprs"><structname>pg_stats_ext_exprs</structname></link> 中新增相关信息（Corey Huinker，Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;307447e6d">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-monitoring">
     <title>监控</title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-02-09 [38e0190ce] Allow log_min_messages to be set per process type
-->

<listitem><para>允许按进程类型指定 <link linkend="guc-log-min-messages"><varname>log_min_messages</varname></link> 日志级别（Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;38e0190ce">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新格式为 "<replaceable>type</replaceable>:<replaceable>level</replaceable>"。不带冒号的值控制所有进程类型，以保持向后兼容。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-10-15 [dd3ae3783] Add log_autoanalyze_min_duration
-->

<listitem><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-log-autoanalyze-min-duration"><varname>log_autoanalyze_min_duration</varname></link>，用于记录 <link linkend="autovacuum">自动清理</link> 执行的耗时较长的分析操作（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dd3ae3783">&sect;</ulink></para><para>服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-log-autovacuum-min-duration"><varname>log_autovacuum_min_duration</varname></link> 现在只控制自动清理执行的清理操作日志。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-09-12 [2aac62be8] Default to log_lock_waits=on
-->

<listitem><para>默认启用服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-log-lock-waits"><varname>log_lock_waits</varname></link>（Laurenz Albe）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2aac62be8">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@postgresql.org>
2025-09-06 [06473f5a3] Allow to log raw parse tree.
-->

<listitem><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-debug-print-raw-parse"><varname>debug_print_raw_parse</varname></link>，用于记录原始解析树（Chao Li）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;06473f5a3">&sect;</ulink></para><para>当服务器以 debug 级别 3 及以上启动时，也会启用该输出。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-07-22 [112faf137] Log remote NOTICE, WARNING, and similar messages using e
-->

<listitem><para>让来自远端服务器的消息以与本地服务器消息相同的格式出现在服务器日志中（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;112faf137">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这包括 replication、<xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 和 <xref linkend="dblink"/> 服务器。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-11-03 [ad25744f4] Add wal_fpi_bytes to VACUUM and ANALYZE logs
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <acronym>WAL</acronym> <link linkend="guc-full-page-writes">整页写入</link>字节报告到 <link linkend="sql-vacuum"><command>VACUUM</command></link> 和 <link linkend="sql-analyze"><command>ANALYZE</command></link> 日志（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ad25744f4">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-02-03 [e05a24c2d] Add two IO wait events for COPY FROM/TO on a pipe/file/p
-->

<listitem><para>为 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM/TO</command></link> 在 管道、文件或程序 上新增 I/O 等待事件（Nikolay Samokhvalov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e05a24c2d">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2026-01-05 [7a39f43d8] Extend xlogwait infrastructure with write and flush wait
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <acronym>WAL</acronym> 写入和刷盘 <link linkend="wal-internals">LSN</link> 的等待事件（Xuneng Zhou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7a39f43d8">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-10-06 [b93172ca5] Expose sequence page LSN via pg_get_sequence_data.
-->

<listitem><para>让 <link linkend="func-pg-get-sequence-data"><function>pg_get_sequence_data()</function></link> 返回序列页 <link linkend="wal-internals"><acronym>LSN</acronym></link>（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b93172ca5">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-12-30 [97b101776] Add pg_get_multixact_stats()
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-info-snapshot"><function>pg_get_multixact_stats()</function></link>，用于报告 <link linkend="vacuum-for-multixact-wraparound">multixact</link> 活动（Naga Appani）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;97b101776">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-20 [48f11bfa0] Bump transaction/multixact ID warning limits to 100M.
-->

<listitem><para>当 xid 和 multi-xids 的<link linkend="vacuum-for-wraparound">回卷</link>距离小于 1 亿时发出警告（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;48f11bfa0">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前的警告阈值为 4000 万。警告会发送给客户端并写入服务器日志。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-server-config">
     <title>服务器配置</title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2026-04-03 [f19c0ecca] Online enabling and disabling of data checksums
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2026-04-08 [b364828f8] doc: Fix data_checksums data type
-->

<listitem><para>允许<link linkend="functions-admin-checksum">在线启用</link>和禁用<link linkend="checksums">数据校验和</link>（Daniel Gustafsson，Magnus Hagander，Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f19c0ecca">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b364828f8">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前只能在集簇离线时通过 <link linkend="app-pgchecksums"><application>pg_checksums</application></link> 更改校验和状态。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-27 [d7965d65f] Add rudimentary table prioritization to autovacuum.
-->

<listitem><para>新增评分系统，用于控制 <link linkend="autovacuum">自动清理</link> 处理表的顺序（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d7965d65f">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增的服务器变量有 <link linkend="guc-autovacuum-freeze-score-weight"><varname>autovacuum_freeze_score_weight</varname></link>、<link linkend="guc-autovacuum-multixact-freeze-score-weight"><varname>autovacuum_multixact_freeze_score_weight</varname></link>、<link linkend="guc-autovacuum-vacuum-score-weight"><varname>autovacuum_vacuum_score_weight</varname></link>、<link linkend="guc-autovacuum-vacuum-insert-score-weight"><varname>autovacuum_vacuum_insert_score_weight</varname></link> 和 <link linkend="guc-autovacuum-analyze-score-weight"><varname>autovacuum_analyze_score_weight</varname></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2026-03-18 [4f433025f] ssl: Serverside SNI support for libpq
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="ssl-sni"><acronym>SNI</acronym></link>（Server Name Indication）服务端支持（Daniel Gustafsson，Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4f433025f">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新的配置文件 <link linkend="guc-hosts-file"><filename>PGDATA/pg_hosts.conf</filename></link> 指定主机名/密钥对。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [b977bd308] oauth: Allow validators to register custom HBA options
-->

<listitem><para>允许 OAuth 验证器注册自定义 <link linkend="auth-pg-hba-conf"><filename>pg_hba.conf</filename></link> 认证选项（Jacob Champion，Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b977bd308">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-02-23 [d98197602] Allow pg_{read,write}_all_data to access large objects.
-->

<listitem><para>允许角色 <link linkend="predefined-role-pg-read-all-data"><literal>pg_read_all_data</literal></link> 和 <link linkend="predefined-role-pg-read-all-data"><literal>pg_write_all_data</literal></link> 读写大对象（Nitin Motiani，Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d98197602">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这些角色旨在允许非超级用户运行 <link linkend="app-pgdump"><application>pg_dump</application></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-06 [f1e251be8] Allow bgworkers to be terminated for database-related co
-->

<listitem>
<para>
允许配置后台工作进程，使其在数据库级操作之前终止（Aya Iwata）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f1e251be8">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
由于现在可以终止造成阻塞的后台工作进程，数据库级操作可以更快完成。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-11-04 [ff4597acd] Allow "SET list_guc TO NULL" to specify setting the GUC
-->

<listitem><para>允许将表示列表的<link linkend="config-setting">服务器变量</link>值设为 <literal>NULL</literal> 来清空它们（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ff4597acd">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
2025-09-24 [5334620ee] Update GB18030 encoding from version 2000 to 2022
-->

<listitem><para>将<link linkend="multibyte-charset-supported">GB18030 编码</link>从 2000 版更新到 2022 版（Chao Li，Zheng Tao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5334620ee">&sect;</ulink></para><para>兼容性细节请参见提交说明。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-replication">
     <title><link linkend="streaming-replication">流复制与恢复</link></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-11-05 [447aae13b] Implement WAIT FOR command
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2026-01-05 [49a181b5d] Add the MODE option to the WAIT FOR LSN command
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增 <link linkend="sql-wait-for"><command>WAIT FOR</command></link> 命令，允许备库等待 <link linkend="wal-internals"><acronym>LSN</acronym></link> 值被写入、刷盘或重放（Kartyshov Ivan，Alexander Korotkov，Xuneng Zhou）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;447aae13b">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;49a181b5d">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-12-15 [0d2d4a0ec] Add retry logic to pg_sync_replication_slots().
-->

<listitem><para>改进 <link linkend="pg-sync-replication-slots"><function>pg_sync_replication_slots()</function></link>，使其等待同步完成（Ajin Cherian，Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d2d4a0ec">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前某些同步失败不会被报告。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [a8f45dee9] Add wal_sender_shutdown_timeout GUC to limit shutdown wa
-->

<listitem><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-wal-sender-shutdown-timeout"><varname>wal_sender_shutdown_timeout</varname></link>，用于限制关闭期间的副本同步等待（Andrey Silitskiy，Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a8f45dee9">&sect;</ulink></para><para>默认情况下，sender 仍会一直等待同步。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-02-20 [8a6af3ad0] Make GUC wal_receiver_timeout user-settable.
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-02-20 [fb80f388f] Add per-subscription wal_receiver_timeout setting.
-->

<listitem><para>允许按订阅和用户设置 <link linkend="guc-wal-receiver-timeout"><varname>wal_receiver_timeout</varname></link>（Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8a6af3ad0">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fb80f388f">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这允许不同订阅端使用不同的 <link linkend="guc-wal-receiver-timeout"><varname>wal_receiver_timeout</varname></link> 值。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-09-19 [5b148706c] Add optional pid parameter to pg_replication_origin_sess
-->

<listitem><para>新增可选 pid 参数到 <link linkend="pg-replication-origin-session-setup"><function>pg_replication_origin_session_setup()</function></link>，以允许 <acronym>SQL</acronym> 级复制方案并行化（Doruk Yilmaz，Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5b148706c">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-logical">
     <title><link linkend="logical-replication">逻辑复制</link></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-10-23 [f0b3573c3] Introduce "REFRESH SEQUENCES" for subscriptions.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-05 [5509055d6] Add sequence synchronization for logical replication.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-11-12 [55cefadde] Doc: Add documentation for sequence synchronization.
-->

<listitem><para>允许订阅者中存储的序列值与发布者一致（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f0b3573c3">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5509055d6">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;55cefadde">&sect;</ulink></para><para>可在 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription"><command>CREATE SUBSCRIPTION</command></link>、<link linkend="sql-altersubscription"><command>ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... REFRESH PUBLICATION</command></link> 和 <link linkend="sql-altersubscription"><command>ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... REFRESH SEQUENCES</command></link> 中启用。后者只更新值，不更新序列存在性。函数 <link linkend="func-pg-get-sequence-data"><function>pg_get_sequence_data()</function></link> 可用于检查序列同步。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-10-09 [96b378497] Add "ALL SEQUENCES" support to publications.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
允许 <link linkend="sql-createpublication"><command>CREATE</command></link>/<link linkend="sql-alterpublication"><command>ALTER PUBLICATION</command></link> 发布所有序列（Vignesh C，Tomas Vondra）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;96b378497">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
此功能通过 <literal>ALL SEQUENCES</literal> 子句启用。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-10-23 [f0b3573c3] Introduce "REFRESH SEQUENCES" for subscriptions.
-->

<listitem><para>允许针对发布执行 <link linkend="sql-altersubscription"><command>ALTER SUBSCRIPTION</command></link>，以同步订阅端上的序列存在性，使其与发布端一致（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f0b3573c3">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过 <literal>REFRESH SEQUENCES</literal> 子句启用此功能。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2026-03-20 [493f8c643] Add support for EXCEPT TABLE in ALTER PUBLICATION.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2026-04-01 [6b0550c45] Fix miscellaneous issues in EXCEPT publication clause.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2026-03-04 [fd366065e] Allow table exclusions in publications via EXCEPT TABLE.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2026-03-31 [5984ea868] Change syntax of EXCEPT TABLE clause in publication comm
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-createpublication"><command>CREATE</command></link>/<link linkend="sql-alterpublication"><command>ALTER PUBLICATION</command></link> 排除某些表（Vignesh C，Shlok Kyal）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;493f8c643">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6b0550c45">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fd366065e">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5984ea868">&sect;</ulink></para><para>该功能通过 <literal>EXCEPT</literal> 子句控制，在指定 <literal>ALL TABLES</literal> 时尤其有用。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-07-23 [228c37086] Preserve conflict-relevant data during logical replicati
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-09-15 [0d48d393d] Resume conflict-relevant data retention automatically.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-09-02 [a850be2fe] Add max_retention_duration option to subscriptions.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
为 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription"><command>CREATE</command></link>/<link linkend="sql-altersubscription"><command>ALTER SUBSCRIPTION</command></link> 新增设置 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription-params-with-retain-dead-tuples"><varname>retain_dead_tuples</varname></link>，用于保留冲突解决所需的信息（Zhijie Hou）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;228c37086">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d48d393d">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a850be2fe">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
同时新增设置 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription-params-with-max-retention-duration"><varname>max_retention_duration</varname></link>，用于限制 <varname>retain_dead_tuples</varname> 的保留时间。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2026-03-06 [8185bb534] CREATE SUBSCRIPTION ... SERVER.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription"><command>CREATE SUBSCRIPTION</command></link> 使用 <xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 外部数据包装器连接参数（Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8185bb534">&sect;</ulink></para><para>连接参数通过 <link linkend="sql-createsubscription"><command>CREATE SUBSCRIPTION ... SERVER</command></link> 引用。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-12-23 [67c20979c] Toggle logical decoding dynamically based on logical slo
-->

<listitem><para>当 <link linkend="guc-wal-level"><varname>wal_level</varname></link> 为 "<literal>replica</literal>" 时，允许在需要时自动启用逻辑复制（Masahiko Sawada）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;67c20979c">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-effective-wal-level"><varname>effective_wal_level</varname></link> 报告有效 <acronym>WAL</acronym> 级别。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-query">
    <title>查询命令</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-16 [2f094e7ac] SQL Property Graph Queries (SQL/PGQ)
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-31 [c5b3253b8] Property references are preferred over regular column re
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-31 [a0dd0702e] Fix cross variable references in graph pattern causing s
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <acronym>SQL</acronym> Property Graph Queries（<acronym>SQL</acronym>/<acronym>PGQ</acronym>）支持（Peter Eisentraut，Ashutosh Bapat）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2f094e7ac">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c5b3253b8">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a0dd0702e">&sect;</ulink></para><para>内部按视图方式处理，因此写作标准关系查询。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-04-01 [8e72d914c] Add UPDATE/DELETE FOR PORTION OF
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-04-07 [b6ccd30d8] Add isolation tests for UPDATE/DELETE FOR PORTION OF
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <literal>FOR PORTION OF</literal> 子句，供 <link linkend="sql-update"><command>UPDATE</command></link> 和 <link linkend="sql-delete"><command>DELETE</command></link> 使用（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8e72d914c">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b6ccd30d8">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这允许对时间范围内的数据进行操作。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-03-06 [415100aa6] Support grouping-expression references and GROUPING() in
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <literal>GROUP BY</literal> 处理目标列表中的子查询，即使其中的表达式引用了子查询之外的列（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;415100aa6">&sect;</ulink></para><para>同时修复了 <link linkend="functions-grouping-table"><function>GROUPING()</function></link> 处理目标列表中的子查询别名时的一个 bug。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@postgresql.org>
2025-10-03 [25a30bbd4] Add IGNORE NULLS/RESPECT NULLS option to Window function
-->

<listitem><para>允许<link linkend="functions-window">窗口函数</link>使用 <literal>IGNORE NULLS</literal>/<literal>RESPECT NULLS</literal> 子句忽略 NULL（Oliver Ford，Tatsuo Ishii）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;25a30bbd4">&sect;</ulink></para><para>支持的窗口函数有 <function>lead()</function>、<function>lag()</function>、<function>first_value()</function>、<function>last_value()</function> 和 <function>nth_value()</function>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2026-02-12 [88327092f] Add support for INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO SELECT.
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="sql-insert"><command>INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO SELECT ... RETURNING</command></link> 支持（Andreas Karlsson，Marko Tiikkaja，Viktor Holmberg）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;88327092f">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这允许返回冲突行，并可选用 <literal>FOR UPDATE</literal>/<literal>SHARE</literal> 加锁。</para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-utility">
    <title>实用命令</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-03-10 [ac58465e0] Introduce the REPACK command
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增 <link linkend="sql-repack"><command>REPACK</command></link> 命令，用于替代 <link linkend="sql-vacuum"><command>VACUUM FULL</command></link> 和 <link linkend="sql-cluster"><command>CLUSTER</command></link>（Antonin Houska）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ac58465e0">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
前两个命令执行类似的操作，但名称容易引起混淆，因此将它们统一为 <link linkend="sql-repack"><command>REPACK</command></link>。旧命令仍予保留，以保持兼容性。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-04-06 [28d534e2a] Add CONCURRENTLY option to REPACK
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-04-07 [8fb95a8ab] doc: Add an example of REPACK (CONCURRENTLY)
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-04-07 [e76d8c749] Reserve replication slots specifically for REPACK
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-repack"><command>REPACK</command></link> 在不获取 ACCESS EXCLUSIVE 锁的情况下重建表（Antonin Houska，Mihail Nikalayeu，Álvaro Herrera）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;28d534e2a">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8fb95a8ab">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e76d8c749">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过 <literal>CONCURRENTLY</literal> 选项启用。还新增了服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-max-repack-replication-slots"><varname>max_repack_replication_slots</varname></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-12-14 [f2e4cc427] Implement ALTER TABLE ... MERGE PARTITIONS ... command
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-12-14 [4b3d17362] Implement ALTER TABLE ... SPLIT PARTITION ... command
-->

<listitem><para>允许使用 <link linkend="sql-altertable"><command>ALTER TABLE ... MERGE/SPLIT PARTITIONS</command></link> 合并和拆分分区（Dmitry Koval，Alexander Korotkov，Tender Wang，Richard Guo，Dagfinn Ilmari Mannsåker，Fujii Masao，Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f2e4cc427">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4b3d17362">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-19 [dd1398f13] Allow choosing specific grantors via GRANT/REVOKE ... GR
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-grant"><command>GRANT</command></link>/<link linkend="sql-revoke"><command>REVOKE</command></link> 指定执行权限调整的有效角色（Nathan Bossart，Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dd1398f13">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过 <literal>GRANTED BY</literal> 子句控制。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-04-06 [d51697484] Support more object types within CREATE SCHEMA.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-createschema"><command>CREATE SCHEMA</command></link> 在新创建的模式中创建更多类型的对象（Kirill Reshke，Jian He，Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d51697484">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-11 [a4f126516] Add option list to CHECKPOINT command.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-11 [2f698d7f4] Add MODE option to CHECKPOINT command.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-11 [8d33fbacb] Add FLUSH_UNLOGGED option to CHECKPOINT command.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-checkpoint"><command>CHECKPOINT</command></link> 接受选项列表（Christoph Berg）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a4f126516">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2f698d7f4">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8d33fbacb">&sect;</ulink></para><para>支持的选项为 <literal>MODE</literal> 和 <literal>FLUSH_UNLOGGED</literal>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2026-03-06 [8185bb534] CREATE SUBSCRIPTION ... SERVER.
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2026-04-09 [90630ec42] Document new catalog columns, missed in commit 8185bb534
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <literal>CONNECTION</literal> 子句到 <link linkend="sql-createforeigndatawrapper"><command>CREATE FOREIGN DATA WRAPPER</command></link>，用于指定将为订阅连接参数调用的函数（Jeff Davis，Noriyoshi Shinoda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8185bb534">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;90630ec42">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-12-30 [736f754ee] Add dead items memory usage to VACUUM (VERBOSE) and auto
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-03-19 [adcdbe938] Add parallel vacuum worker usage to VACUUM (VERBOSE) and
-->

<listitem><para>在 <link linkend="sql-vacuum"><command>VACUUM (VERBOSE)</command></link> 和 <link linkend="autovacuum">自动清理</link> 日志中新增内存使用和并行度报告（Tatsuya Kawata，Daniil Davydov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;736f754ee">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;adcdbe938">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

    <sect4 id="release-19-constraints">
     <title><link linkend="ddl-constraints">约束</link></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-11 [342051d73] Add support for altering CHECK constraint enforceability
-->

<listitem><para>允许使用 <link linkend="sql-altertable"><command>ALTER TABLE ALTER CONSTRAINT ... [NOT] ENFORCED</command></link> 修改 <literal>CHECK</literal> 约束（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;342051d73">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前只有外键约束支持更改强制执行状态。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-02-24 [f80bedd52] Allow ALTER COLUMN SET EXPRESSION on virtual columns wit
-->

<listitem><para>允许在虚拟列上成功执行 <link linkend="sql-altertable"><command>ALTER TABLE ... COLUMN SET EXPRESSION</command></link>，即使它带有 <literal>CHECK</literal> 约束（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f80bedd52">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前这是被禁止的。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-copy">
     <title><xref linkend="sql-copy"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-07-03 [bc2f348e8] Support multi-line headers in COPY FROM command.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM</command></link> 跳过多行表头（Shinya Kato，Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bc2f348e8">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前只能跳过一行表头。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-03 [2a525cc97] Add COPY (on_error set_null) option
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM</command></link> 把无效输入值设置为 <literal>NULL</literal>（Jian He，Kirill Reshke）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2a525cc97">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY</command></link> 选项 <literal>ON_ERROR SET_NULL</literal> 实现。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-20 [7dadd38cd] json format for COPY TO
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-20 [4c0390ac5] Add option force_array for COPY JSON FORMAT
-->

<listitem>
<para>
允许 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY TO</command></link> 输出 <acronym>JSON</acronym> 格式（Joe Conway，Jian He，Andrew Dunstan）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7dadd38cd">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4c0390ac5">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
还可以把 <acronym>JSON</acronym> 输出生成为单个 <acronym>JSON</acronym> 数组，方法是使用 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY</command></link> 选项 <literal>FORCE_ARRAY</literal>。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-10-20 [4bea91f21] Support COPY TO for partitioned tables.
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-11-20 [266543a62] Use "COPY table TO" for partitioned tables in initial ta
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY TO</command></link> 处理分区表（Jian He，Ajin Cherian）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4bea91f21">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;266543a62">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前必须使用 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY (SELECT ...)</command></link> 才能输出分区表。这也改进了逻辑复制中的表同步。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-19-explain">
     <title><xref linkend="sql-explain"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [681daed93] Add EXPLAIN (IO) infrastructure with BitmapHeapScan supp
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [3b1117d6e] Add EXPLAIN (IO) instrumentation for SeqScan
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [e157fe6f7] Add EXPLAIN (IO) instrumentation for TidRangeScan
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command></link> 选项 <literal>IO</literal>，用于报告异步 I/O 活动（Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;681daed93">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3b1117d6e">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e157fe6f7">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-10-30 [5ab0b6a24] Expose wal_fpi_bytes in EXPLAIN (WAL)
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <acronym>WAL</acronym> <link linkend="guc-full-page-writes">整页写入</link>字节数报告到 <link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, WAL)</command></link> 输出（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5ab0b6a24">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2025-07-29 [4bc62b868] Display Memoize planner estimates in EXPLAIN
-->

<listitem><para>在 <link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN</command></link> 输出中新增 Memoize 缓存和查找估计值（Ilia Evdokimov，Lukas Fittl）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4bc62b868">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这有助于说明为什么选择了 Memoize。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-datatypes">
    <title>数据类型</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-07 [b139bd3b6] Add data type oid8, 64-bit unsigned identifier
-->

<listitem><para>新增 64 位无符号数据类型 <link linkend="datatype-oid"><type>oid8</type></link>（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b139bd3b6">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-04-02 [bd4f879a9] Add additional jsonpath string methods
-->

<listitem><para>新增更多 <link linkend="datatype-jsonpath"><type>jsonpath</type></link> 字符串方法（Florents Tselai，David E. Wheeler）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bd4f879a9">&sect;</ulink></para><para>包括 <link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>ltrim()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>rtrim()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>btrim()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>lower()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>upper()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>initcap()</function></link>、<link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>replace()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="functions-sqljson-path-operators"><function>split_part()</function></link>。它们与非 <acronym>JSON</acronym> 字符串变体一样是不可变的。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-03-19 [ba21f5bf8] Allow explicit casting between bytea and uuid.
-->

<listitem><para>允许在 <link linkend="datatype-binary"><type>bytea</type></link> 和 <link linkend="datatype-uuid"><type>uuid</type></link> 之间进行类型转换（Dagfinn Ilmari Mannsåker，Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ba21f5bf8">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-06-30 [bd09f024a] Add new OID alias type regdatabase.
-->

<listitem><para>允许使用 <link linkend="datatype-oid"><type>regdatabase</type></link> 在数据库名和 <link linkend="datatype-oid"><type>oid8</type></link> 之间转换（Ian Lawrence Barwick）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bd09f024a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2026-04-05 [df6949ccf] Add tid_block() and tid_offset() accessor functions
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="functions-tid"><function>tid_block()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="functions-tid"><function>tid_offset()</function></link> 函数，用于从 <link linkend="datatype-oid"><type>tid</type></link> 值中提取块号和偏移量（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;df6949ccf">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-functions">
    <title>函数</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-09-09 [faf071b55] Add date and timestamp variants of random(min, max).
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-09-11 [9c24111c4] doc: Improve description of new random(min, max) functio
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="datatype-datetime"><type>date</type></link>、<link linkend="datatype-datetime"><type>timestamp</type></link> 和 <link linkend="datatype-datetime"><type>timestamptz</type></link> 版本的 <link linkend="functions-math-random-table"><literal>random(min, max)</literal></link>（Damien Clochard，Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;faf071b55">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9c24111c4">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-03-25 [497c1170c] Add base32hex support to encode() and decode() functions
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2026-03-27 [e752a2ccc] doc: Clarify collation requirements for base32hex sortab
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-09-20 [e1d917182] Add support for base64url encoding and decoding
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="functions-binarystring-conversions"><function>encode()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="functions-binarystring-conversions"><function>decode()</function></link> 处理 <literal>base64url</literal> 和 <literal>base32hex</literal> 格式的数据（Andrey Borodin，Aleksander Alekseev，Florents Tselai）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;497c1170c">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e752a2ccc">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e1d917182">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这种格式保留顺序，不像 <literal>base32</literal>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-11-22 [5eed8ce50] Add range_minus_multi and multirange_minus_multi functio
-->

<listitem><para>新增用于返回范围减法结果范围集的函数（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5eed8ce50">&sect;</ulink></para><para>函数为 <link linkend="range-functions-table"><function>range_minus_multi()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="multirange-functions-table"><function>multirange_minus_multi()</function></link>。这对表示带间隙的范围减法结果很有用。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-10-22 [2b75c38b7] Add error_on_null(), checking if the input is the null v
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-comparison-func-table"><function>error_on_null()</function></link>，用于返回提供的参数，或在 <literal>NULL</literal> 输入时报告错误（Joel Jacobson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2b75c38b7">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-17 [3b4c2b9db] Allow IS JSON predicate to work with domain types
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="functions-sqljson-misc"><literal>IS JSON</literal></link> 在定义于受支持基础类型之上的域上工作（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3b4c2b9db">&sect;</ulink></para><para>受支持的基础类型为 <link linkend="datatype-character"><type>TEXT</type></link>、<link linkend="datatype-json"><type>JSON</type></link>、<link linkend="datatype-json"><type>JSONB</type></link> 和 <link linkend="datatype-binary"><type>BYTEA</type></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-01-05 [7dc95cc3b] Update to latest Snowball sources.
-->

<listitem><para>新增波兰语和世界语的<link linkend="textsearch-snowball-dictionary">全文词干分析器</link>（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7dc95cc3b">&sect;</ulink></para><para>荷兰语词干分析器也已更新。旧版荷兰语词干分析器可通过 <link linkend="textsearch-snowball-dictionary"><literal>dutch_porter</literal></link> 使用。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-04-05 [76e514ebb] Add pg_get_role_ddl() function
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-get-object-ddl-table"><function>pg_get_role_ddl()</function></link>，用于输出角色创建命令（Mario Gonzalez，Bryan Green，Andrew Dunstan，Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;76e514ebb">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-04-05 [b99fd9fd7] Add pg_get_tablespace_ddl() function
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-get-object-ddl-table"><function>pg_get_tablespace_ddl()</function></link>，用于输出表空间创建命令（Nishant Sharma，Manni Wood，Andrew Dunstan，Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b99fd9fd7">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-04-05 [a4f774cf1] Add pg_get_database_ddl() function
-->

<listitem><para>新增函数 <link linkend="functions-get-object-ddl-table"><function>pg_get_database_ddl()</function></link>，用于输出数据库创建命令（Akshay Joshi，Andrew Dunstan，Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a4f774cf1">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-08-21 [53eff471c] PL/Python: Add event trigger support
-->

<listitem><para>允许使用 <link linkend="plpython"><application>PL/Python</application></link> 编写事件触发器（Euler Taveira，Dimitri Fontaine）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;53eff471c">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-libpq">
    <title><link linkend="libpq">Libpq</link></title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-07-13 [092f3c63e] libpq: Add "servicefile" connection option
-->

<listitem><para>允许 libpq 连接通过 "<link linkend="libpq-connect-servicefile"><literal>servicefile</literal></link>" 指定服务文件（Torsten Förtsch，Ryo Kanbayashi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;092f3c63e">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-02-06 [d8d7c5dc8] libpq: Prepare for protocol grease during 19beta
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增用于兼容性测试的特殊 libpq 协议参数（Jelte Fennema-Nio，Jacob Champion）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d8d7c5dc8">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
这也称为 <ulink url="https://wiki.postgresql.org/wiki/Grease">protocol grease</ulink>，曾在 19 beta 期间启用。从 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 19 正式版开始将不再发送这些参数，但相关参数保留项仍会保留，以备将来使用。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-03-30 [993368113] libpq: Add oauth_ca_file option to change CAs without de
-->

<listitem><para>新增 libpq 连接参数 <link linkend="libpq-connect-oauth-ca-file"><varname>oauth_ca_file</varname></link>，用于在与 OAuth 提供者通信时指定其他证书颁发机构（Jonathan Gonzalez V.，Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;993368113">&sect;</ulink></para><para>也可以通过环境变量 <link linkend="libpq-envars"><envar>PGOAUTHCAFILE</envar></link> 设置。默认使用 <application>curl</application> 内置证书。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [6d00fb904] libpq: Split PGOAUTHDEBUG=UNSAFE into multiple options
-->

<listitem><para>允许 libpq 环境变量 <link linkend="libpq-envars"><envar>PGOAUTHDEBUG</envar></link> 指定具体调试选项（Zsolt Parragi，Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6d00fb904">&sect;</ulink></para><para><literal>UNSAFE</literal> 选项仍会生成全部调试输出。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-03-06 [e982331b5] libpq: Introduce PQAUTHDATA_OAUTH_BEARER_TOKEN_V2
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-03-31 [0af4d402c] libpq: Poison the v2 part of a v1 Bearer request
-->

<listitem>
<para>
改进自定义 OAuth 客户端流程（Jacob Champion）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e982331b5">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0af4d402c">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
此前，自定义流程失败时 libpq 只报告一条通用错误消息，并且每个流程实现都必须独立计算 issuer 标识符。新增 authdata 钩子类型 <link linkend="libpq-oauth-authdata-oauth-bearer-token-v2"><literal>PQAUTHDATA_OAUTH_BEARER_TOKEN_V2</literal></link>，它会预先计算 issuer ID，并允许钩子提供错误细节。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-03-05 [b8d768583] libpq: Add PQgetThreadLock() to mirror PQregisterThreadL
-->

<listitem><para>新增 libpq 函数 <link linkend="libpq-threading"><function>PQgetThreadLock()</function></link>，用于获取当前锁回调（Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b8d768583">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-psql">
    <title><xref linkend="app-psql"/></title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-10-28 [b3ce55f41] Add psql PROMPT variable for search_path.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 通过 <link linkend="app-psql-prompting-S"><literal>%S</literal></link> 在提示符中显示 search_path（Florents Tselai）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b3ce55f41">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这在 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 连接到 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 或更高版本时有效。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-02-03 [dddbbc253] psql: Add %i prompt escape to indicate hot standby statu
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 通过 <link linkend="app-psql-prompting-i"><literal>%i</literal></link> 在提示符中显示热备状态（Jim Jones）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dddbbc253">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-02-28 [aecc55866] psql: Show comments in \dRp+, \dRs+, and \dX+ psql meta-
-->

<listitem><para>修改 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 反斜杠命令，以显示发布、订阅和扩展统计信息的注释（Fujii Masao，Jim Jones）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;aecc55866">&sect;</ulink></para><para>受影响的命令为 <link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-drp"><literal>\dRp+</literal></link>、<link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-drs"><literal>\dRs+</literal></link> 和 <link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-dx-uc"><literal>\dX+</literal></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2025-11-03 [645cb44c5] Add \pset options for boolean value display
-->

<listitem><para>允许在 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 中控制 boolean 值的显示方式（David G. Johnston）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;645cb44c5">&sect;</ulink></para><para>\pset 变量为 <link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-pset-display-true"><varname>display_true</varname></link> 和 <link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-pset-display-false"><varname>display_false</varname></link>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-07-14 [6b1c4d326] psql: Add variable SERVICEFILE
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 变量 <link linkend="app-psql-variables-servicefile"><varname>SERVICEFILE</varname></link>，用于引用服务文件位置（Ryo Kanbayashi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6b1c4d326">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-10-07 [27da1a796] Improve psql's ability to select pager mode accurately.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> 更准确地判断是否需要 <link linkend="app-psql-meta-command-pset-pager">pager</link>（Erik Wienhold）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;27da1a796">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

