2026-01-07 [28c4b8a05] psql: Add tab completion for pstdin and pstdout in \copy
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-03-02 [0bf7d4ca9] psql: Add tab completion for DELETE ... USING.
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-03-02 [344b572e3] psql: Tab-complete ALTER ROLE ... IN DATABASE SET/RESET
-->

<listitem><para>新增或改进 <link linkend="app-psql"><application>psql</application></link> tab completion（Yamaguchi Atsuo，Yugo Nagata，Haruna Miwa，Xuneng Zhou，Dagfinn Ilmari Mannsåker，Fujii Masao，Álvaro Herrera，Jian He，Tatsuya Kawata，Ian Lawrence Barwick，Vasuki M）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5fa7837d9">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c6a7d3bab">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;81966c545">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a1f7f91be">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6d2ff1de4">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;02fd47dbf">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;14ee8e640">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ff0bcb248">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;86c539c5a">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a604affad">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a4c10de92">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;28c4b8a05">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0bf7d4ca9">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;344b572e3">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-server-apps">
    <title>服务器应用程序</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-27 [c32fb29e9] Include extended statistics data in pg_dump
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-pgdump"><application>pg_dump</application></link> 包含可恢复的扩展统计信息（Corey Huinker）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c32fb29e9">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-08-20 [6429e5b77] vacuumdb: Make vacuumdb - -analyze-only process partition
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-06-03 [95b6ec52e] vacuumdb: Fix - -analyze-in-stages skipping partitioned t
-->

<listitem>
<para>
修改 <link linkend="app-vacuumdb"><application>vacuumdb</application></link> 的 <option>--analyze-only</option> 和 <option>--analyze-in-stages</option> 选项，使其在未指定目标时也分析分区表（Laurenz Albe，Mircea Cadariu，Chao Li）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6429e5b77">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;95b6ec52e">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
此前它会跳过分区表。现在其行为与 <link linkend="sql-analyze"><command>ANALYZE</command></link> 一致。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-12-09 [d107176d2] vacuumdb: Add - -dry-run.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-vacuumdb"><application>vacuumdb</application></link> 使用 <option>--dry-run</option> 选项报告将要执行的命令而不实际运行（Corey Huinker）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d107176d2">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-20 [b3cf461b3] pg_verifybackup: Enable WAL parsing for tar-format backu
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-pgverifybackup"><application>pg_verifybackup</application></link> 读取 <acronym>WAL</acronym> 文件，这些文件存储在 <application>tar</application> 归档中（Amul Sul）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b3cf461b3">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增 <option>--wal-path</option> 选项，作为现有且已弃用的 <option>--wal-directory</option> 选项的别名。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2026-03-20 [b15c15139] pg_waldump: Add support for reading WAL from tar archive
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="pgwaldump"><application>pg_waldump</application></link> 读取 <acronym>WAL</acronym> 文件，这些文件存储在 <application>tar</application> 归档中（Amul Sul）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b15c15139">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-09-08 [3bcfcd815] pg_upgrade: Transfer pg_largeobject_metadata's files whe
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-02-09 [158408fef] pg_upgrade: Fix handling of pg_largeobject_metadata.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-18 [161a3e8b6] pg_upgrade: Use COPY for large object metadata.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-02-16 [b33f75361] pg_upgrade: Use COPY for LO metadata for upgrades from
-->

<listitem>
<para>
改进 <link linkend="pgupgrade"><application>pg_upgrade</application></link> 复制大对象元数据的性能（Nathan Bossart）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3bcfcd815">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;158408fef">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;161a3e8b6">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b33f75361">&sect;</ulink>
</para>

<para>
根据旧集簇的 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 版本采用不同的方法。
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-07-30 [412036c22] Teach pg_upgrade to handle in-place tablespaces.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="pgupgrade"><application>pg_upgrade</application></link> 处理存放在 <envar>PGDATA</envar> 目录中的非默认表空间（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;412036c22">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前这类表空间会报错。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-11-07 [0ab208fa5] pgbench: Add - -continue-on-error option.
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="pgbench"><application>pgbench</application></link> 选项 <option>--continue-on-error</option>，以在 <acronym>SQL</acronym> 错误后继续执行（Rintaro Ikeda，Yugo Nagata，Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0ab208fa5">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-07-08 [0b096e379] Change pg_test_timing to measure in nanoseconds not micr
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-07-09 [9dcc76414] Minor tweaks for pg_test_timing.
-->

<listitem><para>改进 <link linkend="pgtesttiming"><application>pg_test_timing</application></link> 的可用性（Hannu Krosing，Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0b096e379">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9dcc76414">&sect;</ulink></para><para>现在报告纳秒而不是微秒；除直方图输出外，还会输出第二张精确计时表，并可通过 <option>--cutoff</option> 指定可选截断。</para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    <sect4 id="release-19-pg-createsubscriber">
     <title><link linkend="app-pgcreatesubscriber"><application>pg_createsubscriber</application></link></title>

     <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-12-17 [85ddcc2f4] Support existing publications in pg_createsubscriber.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="app-pgcreatesubscriber"><application>pg_createsubscriber</application></link> 忽略已存在的指定发布（Shubham Khanna）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;85ddcc2f4">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前这会报错。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-01-08 [639352d90] pg_createsubscriber: Improve handling of automated recov
-->

<listitem><para>更改 <link linkend="app-pgcreatesubscriber"><application>pg_createsubscriber</application></link> 存储恢复参数的方式（Alyona Vinter）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;639352d90">&sect;</ulink></para><para>变更会存放在可选包含的 <filename>pg_createsubscriber.conf</filename> 中，而不是直接写入 <filename>postgresql.auto.conf</filename>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2026-03-25 [6b5b7eae3] pg_createsubscriber: Add -l/- -logdir option to redirect
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <link linkend="app-pgcreatesubscriber"><application>pg_createsubscriber</application></link> 选项 <option>-l</option>/<option>--logdir</option>，用于把输出重定向到文件（Gyan Sreejith，Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6b5b7eae3">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-source-code">
    <title>源代码</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-02-23 [ecae09725] Cope with AIX's alignment woes by using _Pragma("pack").
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-02-23 [4a1b05caa] Restore AIX support.
-->

<listitem><para>恢复对 <link linkend="installation-notes-aix"><systemitem class="osname">AIX</systemitem></link> 的支持（Aditya Kamath，Srirama Kucherlapati，Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ecae09725">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4a1b05caa">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这使用 <application>gcc</application>，并且只支持 64 位构建。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2026-03-14 [0123ce131] Switch the semaphore API on Solaris to unnamed POSIX.
-->

<listitem><para>将 <link linkend="installation-notes-solaris"><systemitem class="osname">Solaris</systemitem></link> 改为使用未命名 <acronym>POSIX</acronym> 信号量（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0123ce131">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前使用的是 System V 信号量。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-07-01 [8fd9bb1d9] Enable MSVC conforming preprocessor
-->

<listitem><para>要求 <link linkend="installation-notes-visual-studio"><application>Visual Studio 2019</application></link> 或更高版本（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8fd9bb1d9">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-01-14 [2bc60f862] Enable Python Limited API for PL/Python on MSVC
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="installation-notes-visual-studio"><productname>MSVC</productname></link> 为 <link linkend="plpython"><application>PL/Python</application></link> 使用 Python Limited <acronym>API</acronym> 进行构建（Bryan Green）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2bc60f862">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-01-07 [a516b3f00] MSVC: Support building for AArch64.
-->

<listitem><para>允许使用 <link linkend="installation-notes-visual-studio"><productname>MSVC</productname></link> 在 AArch64 上构建（Niyas Sait，Greg Burd，Dave Cramer）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a516b3f00">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-02-24 [65707ed9a] Add backtrace support for Windows using DbgHelp API
-->

<listitem><para>允许在 <link linkend="installation-notes-visual-studio"><application>Windows</application></link> 上使用 <literal>DbgHelp</literal> 获取执行栈回溯（Bryan Green）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;65707ed9a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-08-26 [f5e0186f8] Raise C requirement to C11
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-09-11 [4fbe01514] Remove checks for no longer supported GCC versions
-->

<listitem><para>将支持的 C 语言版本改为 C11（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f5e0186f8">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4fbe01514">&sect;</ulink></para><para>此前使用 C99。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-04-01 [76f4b92ba] Use standard C23 and C++ attributes if available
-->

<listitem><para>在可用时使用标准 C23 和 C++ 属性（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;76f4b92ba">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
2026-04-04 [5e13b0f24] Use AVX2 for calculating page checksums where available
-->

<listitem><para>使用 <acronym>AVX2</acronym> <acronym>CPU</acronym> 指令计算<link linkend="checksums">页面校验和</link>（Matthew Sterrett，Andrew Kim）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5e13b0f24">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
2026-04-04 [fbc57f2bc] Compute CRC32C on ARM using the Crypto Extension where a
-->

<listitem><para>使用 <productname>ARM</productname> Crypto Extension 计算 CRC32C（John Naylor）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fbc57f2bc">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-10-06 [ec8719ccb] Optimize hex_encode() and hex_decode() using SIMD.
-->

<listitem><para>修改 <link linkend="functions-binarystring"><function>hex_encode()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="functions-binarystring"><function>hex_decode()</function></link>，使其使用 <acronym>SIMD</acronym> <acronym>CPU</acronym> 指令（Nathan Bossart，Chiranmoy Bhattacharya）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ec8719ccb">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-07-02 [f039c2244] meson: Increase minimum version to 0.57.2
-->

<listitem><para>要求 <link linkend="install-meson"><application>Meson</application></link> 版本 0.57.2 或更高（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f039c2244">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-02-23 [78727dcba] meson: allow disabling building/installation of static l
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <application>Meson</application> 选项，用于同时构建共享库和静态库，或仅构建共享库（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;78727dcba">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-20 [57ee39795] Update Unicode data to Unicode 17.0.0
-->

<listitem><para>更新 <link linkend="collation-managing-standard">Unicode</link> 数据到 17.0.0 版（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;57ee39795">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-10-08 [94f3ad396] Add planner_setup_hook and planner_shutdown_hook.
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-01-28 [4020b370f] Allow for plugin control over path generation strategies
-->

<listitem>
<para>
新增钩子 <literal>planner_setup_hook</literal>、<literal>planner_shutdown_hook</literal>、<literal>joinrel_setup_hook</literal> 和 <literal>join_path_setup_hook</literal>（Robert Haas）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;94f3ad396">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4020b370f">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-11-22 [b140c8d7a] Add SupportRequestInlineInFrom planner support request.
-->

<listitem><para>允许扩展将<link linkend="xfunc-sql-functions-returning-set">返回集合函数</link>替换为 <literal>FROM</literal> 子句中的 <acronym>SQL</acronym> 查询（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b140c8d7a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-12-09 [bd8d9c9bd] Widen MultiXactOffset to 64 bits
-->

<listitem><para>将<link linkend="functions-info-snapshot">multixid 成员</link>改为 64 位（Maxim Orlov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bd8d9c9bd">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2026-03-30 [bab2f27ea] Remove bits* typedefs.
-->

<listitem><para>将函数原型中的 <literal>bit*</literal> typedef 改为 <literal>uint*</literal>（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bab2f27ea">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
2026-04-07 [0d3dba38c] Allow logical replication snapshots to be database-speci
-->

<listitem><para>允许<link linkend="logicaldecoding-pgoutput">逻辑解码插件</link>指定其是否不访问共享目录（Antonin Houska）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d3dba38c">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2026-04-03 [d438a3659] oauth: Let validators provide failure DETAILs
-->

<listitem><para>允许 OAuth 验证器提供失败细节（Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d438a3659">&sect;</ulink></para><para>通过设置 <link linkend="oauth-validator-callback-validate"><structname>ValidatorModuleResult</structname></link> 结构体成员 error_detail 实现。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2026-04-06 [283e823f9] Introduce a new mechanism for registering shared memory
-->

<listitem><para>新增简化且改进的共享内存注册函数 <link linkend="xfunc-shared-addin-at-startup"><function>ShmemRequestStruct()</function></link>（Heikki Linnakangas，Ashutosh Bapat）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;283e823f9">&sect;</ulink></para><para><link linkend="xfunc-shared-addin-at-startup"><function>ShmemInitStruct()</function></link> 和 <link linkend="xfunc-shared-addin-at-startup"><function>ShmemInitHash()</function></link> 仍保留以兼容旧代码。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-11-26 [b3fe098d3] Add GUC to show EXEC_BACKEND state
-->

<listitem><para>新增服务器变量 <link linkend="guc-debug-exec-backend"><varname>debug_exec_backend</varname></link>，用于报告参数如何传递给新后端（Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b3fe098d3">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-11-05 [e4d8a2af0] doc: Add section for temporal tables
-->

<listitem><para>新增关于 <link linkend="ddl-temporal-tables">时态表</link> 的文档章节（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e4d8a2af0">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-12 [02976b0a1] doc: Document variables for path substitution in SQL tes
-->

<listitem><para>记录控制<link linkend="regress-run-path-substitution">回归测试</link>的环境变量（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;02976b0a1">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-03-03 [b30656ce0] doc: Add restart on failure to example systemd file
-->

<listitem><para>更新文档中的<link linkend="server-start">systemd 示例</link>，加入 restart 设置（Andrew Jackson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b30656ce0">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-19-modules">
    <title>附加模块</title>

    <itemizedlist>
<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-03-12 [5883ff30b] Add pg_plan_advice contrib module.
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-03-26 [6455e55b0] pg_plan_advice: Invent DO_NOT_SCAN(relation_identifier).
-->

<listitem><para>新增 <xref linkend="pgplanadvice"/> 模块，用于稳定和控制规划器决策（Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5883ff30b">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6455e55b0">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [e8ec19aa3] Add pg_stash_advice contrib module.
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [c10edb102] pg_stash_advice: Allow stashed advice to be persisted to
-->

<listitem><para>新增扩展 <xref linkend="pgstashadvice"/>，用于按 query-id 指定建议（Robert Haas，Lukas Fittl）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e8ec19aa3">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c10edb102">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-07-02 [bee23ea4d] Show sizes of FETCH queries as constants in pg_stat_stat
-->

<listitem><para>将 <link linkend="sql-fetch"><command>FETCH</command></link> 查询的大小作为常量显示在 <xref linkend="pgstatstatements"/> 中（Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bee23ea4d">&sect;</ulink></para><para>不同大小的 FETCH 现在会在 <xref linkend="pgstatstatements"/> 输出中归并到一起。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-07-31 [3357471cf] pg_stat_statements: Add counters for generic and custom
-->

<listitem><para>新增<link linkend="sql-prepare">通用计划和自定义计划</link>计数到 <xref linkend="pgstatstatements"/>（Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3357471cf">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-11-24 [4b203d499] pg_buffercache: Add pg_buffercache_os_pages
-->

<listitem><para>重构 <xref linkend="pgbuffercache"/> 的共享内存映射报告（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4b203d499">&sect;</ulink></para><para>新增函数 <function>pg_buffercache_os_pages()</function> 和系统视图 <structname>pg_buffercache_os_pages</structname>，用于报告共享内存映射；函数还可选包含 <acronym>NUMA</acronym> 细节。为向后兼容，<function>pg_buffercache_numa_pages()</function> 仍然保留。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-11-28 [9ccc049df] pg_buffercache: Add pg_buffercache_mark_dirty{,_relation
-->

<listitem><para>为 <xref linkend="pgbuffercache"/> 新增将缓冲区标记为脏的函数（Nazir Bilal Yavuz）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9ccc049df">&sect;</ulink></para><para>这些函数为 <function>pg_buffercache_mark_dirty()</function>、<function>pg_buffercache_mark_dirty_relation()</function> 和 <function>pg_buffercache_mark_dirty_all()</function>。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-07-18 [62c3b4cd9] Support for deparsing of ArrayCoerceExpr node in contrib
-->

<listitem><para>允许在<link linkend="sql-prepare">预备语句</link>中向 <xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 外部服务器下推数组比较（Alexander Pyhalov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;62c3b4cd9">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Etsuro Fujita <efujita@postgresql.org>
2026-04-08 [28972b6fc] Add support for importing statistics from remote servers
-->

<listitem><para>允许从<link linkend="sql-createforeigndatawrapper">外部数据包装器服务器</link>获取统计信息（Corey Huinker，Etsuro Fujita）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;28972b6fc">&sect;</ulink></para><para><xref linkend="postgres-fdw"/> 通过 <literal>restore_stats</literal> 选项启用此功能。默认情况下，<link linkend="sql-analyze"><command>ANALYZE</command></link> 会从远端服务器取回行并在本地生成统计信息。</para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2026-01-22 [26cb14aea] file_fdw: Support multi-line HEADER option.
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <xref linkend="file-fdw"/> 读取使用多行 HEADER 的文件或程序输出（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;26cb14aea">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2026-04-07 [61c36a34a] auto_explain: Add new GUC auto_explain.log_io
-->

<listitem><para>新增服务器变量 <varname>auto_explain.log_io</varname>，为 <link linkend="auto-explain"><application>auto_explain</application></link> 添加 IO 报告（Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;61c36a34a">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2026-04-06 [e972dff6c] auto_explain: Add new GUC, auto_explain.log_extension_op
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <link linkend="auto-explain"><application>auto_explain</application></link> 添加扩展特定的 <link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN</command></link> 选项，并通过服务器变量 <varname>auto_explain.log_extension_options</varname> 控制（Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e972dff6c">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-07-03 [e2b64fcef] Add cross-type comparisons to contrib/btree_gin.
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-07-03 [fc896821c] Add more cross-type comparisons to contrib/btree_gin.
-->

<listitem>
<para>
修改 <xref linkend="btree-gin"/>，使其支持 btree 所支持的所有跨类型比较（Tom Lane）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e2b64fcef">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc896821c">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-11 [4c910f3bb] bloom: Optimize bitmap scan path with streaming read
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-12 [d841ca2d1] bloom: Optimize VACUUM and bulk-deletion with streaming
-->

<listitem><para>通过流式读取改进 <xref linkend="bloom"/> 索引性能（Xuneng Zhou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4c910f3bb">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d841ca2d1">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-13 [213f0079b] pgstattuple: Optimize btree and hash index functions wit
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-03-14 [ae58189a4] pgstattuple: Optimize pgstattuple_approx() with streamin
-->

<listitem>
<para>
使用流式读取改进 <xref linkend="pgstattuple"/> 的性能（Xuneng Zhou）
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;213f0079b">&sect;</ulink>
<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ae58189a4">&sect;</ulink>
</para>
</listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2026-01-12 [e39ece034] Make dmetaphone collation-aware
-->

<listitem><para>允许 <xref linkend="fuzzystrmatch"/> 的 <function>dmetaphone()</function> 使用 <acronym>ASCII</acronym> 以外的单字节编码（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e39ece034">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2026-02-05 [3c5ec35de] oid2name: Add relation path to the information provided
-->

<listitem><para>修改 <link linkend="oid2name"><application>oid2name</application></link> <option>--extended</option> 以报告关系文件路径（David Bidoc）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3c5ec35de">&sect;</ulink></para></listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

  </sect2>

